{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot-workspace/tests/conformance/contract.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-06T18:03:24.606389Z","id":"957f6b960da3c0a0c00ef0ffc8efaa75847f1cdfd3daa7dfc678a4dca3025e45","body":{"detail":"It runs against Docker or Daytona, whose listings lag by their own documentation and offer nothing to wait on. Its deadline is a hang guard for a condition outside this process, not a budget on Clax. check_env_stays_out_of_argv no longer sleeps: it looks for as long as the command runs.","kind":"waiver","span":{"start":{"line":67},"end":{"line":78},"content_hash":"bf33f211030fbe6cf75f9aa491adedfb75d1d35957c8d6e8458fcd8c25ed1b27"},"summary":"settled keeps a poll and a deadline: it waits on a live runtime","tags":["session:claude-code:bd147c0a-6c5a-4917-88d4-4f47695eae89"]}}
